OL,3,A'I don't want to send you to prison',
OL,4,Awitness tells Tupac accused in
OL,5,Acombative testimony
OL,6,
OL,7,FMcDonald was asked repeatedly whether
OL,8,Fhe could identify who was responsible
OL,9,Ffor Shakur's death. "You're asking me
OL,10,Fsomething that wouldn't be good for
OL,11,Fhim," he said pointing to Davis. "I
OL,12,Fdon't want to send you to prison," he
OL,13,Falso told the accused.
